      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "carryover_20",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_percentage",
            value: 40,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "ai_caution",
            value: 0.5,
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "carryover_bonus",
            value: "yes",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_21",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "the_king_is_dead.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Bitter and alone, Malin follows the back-trail of the orcish band north from Parthyn. He curses the mages for casting him out from the Isle of Alduin only half-trained, unprepared for conflict. He curses Drogan for lacking the resolve to make the necessary sacrifices to protect their home. Most fiercely, he curses the orcs for their mindless savagery, pillagers and raiders who view violence as little more than sport."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_22",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Three days’ travel northeast, Malin stumbles upon Darken Volk, the necromancer who had saved Parthyn and taught him to raise the dead. The dark mage suggests that they travel together; Malin obliges, having been abandoned by his kinsmen. As the weeks pass, Darken Volk teaches Malin more dark magic."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_23",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Malin_Keshar,Darken_Volk,T_shar_Lggi",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "clock_24",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "turn_limit",
            value: 17,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _("Occupy all of the goblin villages"),
        defeat: _("Death of Malin Keshar Death of Darken Volk Turns run out"),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_1",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "nunc_dimittis.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "knolls.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "casualties_of_war.ogg",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_2",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:capture_village",
            side: 2,
            cells: "",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_3",
        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Walking%20Corpse%22%2C%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22variation%22%3A%22drake%2Cdwarf%2Cgoblin%2Cgryphon%2Cmounted%2Csaurian%2Cspider%2Cswimmer%2Ctroll%2Cwose%2Cwolf%2Cbat%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_wml%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22experience%22%3A%220%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 8,
            y: 2,
            item_name: "",
            image: "terrain%2Fcastle%2Fencampment%2Ftent2.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "key",
            value: 0,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_4",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("In truth, I share your hatred for the orcs. The Northlands have been my home for many years and the orcs have been a growing infestation in recent times. They despoil the beauty of the land wherever they go, hacking and burning everything without care or concern. If you are interested, I would be happy to take you on as my... apprentice... so that I can teach you to fight against them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Yes! These orcs have threatened my friends and my home for too long. It’s time I gained the power to put them in their place."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Yes, perhaps removing the threat of orcish raids will persuade the people of Parthyn to welcome you back. But for now, I must train you. The orcs are powerful in the hills, strong enough that even I dare not confront them directly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Then what shall we do?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Strike at them where they are weak. A goblin village lies in this valley, just ahead. They are the bastard children of the orcs, feeble creatures individually, but annoying enough in large numbers. Subduing them will provide us a supply of fresh corpses and souls to use against the orcs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("... It will be a worthwhile test of your skills."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_5",
        on: "capture",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_capturer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Beware the goblin guards in the villages."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 6,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Someone dropped a key here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 7,
            y: 9,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "key",
            value: 1,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 3,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "variable",
                name: "key",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("There are some rotten corpses in this cage."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Make use of them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("A necromancer must always use whatever supplies he is given. Do it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 300,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "zombie-hit-2.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 300,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_1",
            type: "Walking Corpse",
            side: 1,
            x: 3,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_1",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_2",
            type: "Soulless",
            side: 1,
            x: 3,
            y: 11,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_2",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 4,
            y: 12,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "key",
            value: 2,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "attack",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_attacker_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Malin%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Eeeek! Don’t kill me!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Why do you hesitate? Did the orcs show your people any mercy when they attacked Parthyn?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("... No."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "attack",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_attacker_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Ghoul%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Ruuuun! The monster’s going to eat us!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_11",
        on: "branch_if_11",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "number_of_guards",
            greater_than: 0,
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "capture",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_capturer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "variable_compare",
                variable: "village_$x1|_$y1|_cleared",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_rand",
            variable: "number_of_guards",
            values: "0..2",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_locations",
            variable: "_mwg_random_locations_0",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_adjacent_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%22%24x1%22%2C%22y%22%3A%22%24y1%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22not%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:random_count",
            source: "_mwg_random_locations_0",
            variable: "_mwg_random_remaining_2",
            expr: "$number_of_guards",
            allow_less: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "while",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "condition",
                variable: "_mwg_random_remaining_2",
                greater_than: 0,
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:random_location",
                source: "_mwg_random_locations_0",
                variable: "_mwg_random_pick_1",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "_mwg_random_remaining_2",
                value: -1,
                mode: "add",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "village_$x1|_$y1|_cleared",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_11",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: "12-18",
            y: "7-9",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Ahhh... I did not realize there was a swamp near this village. Malin, it would be beneficial for your training if we were to investigate."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Darken%20Volk%2CMalin%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22terrain%22%3A%22Ss%2CSs%5E*%2CSm%2CSm%5E*%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Rise from the realms of death and decay!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 18,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_3",
            type: "Ghoul",
            side: 1,
            x: 18,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_3",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_4",
            type: "Ghoul",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_4",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_5",
            type: "Ghoul",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_5",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("What are these things?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("They are ghouls — noxious beings fashioned from living flesh into carcasses of disease and poison. Those that outlive their masters gravitate towards the natural decay present in swamps and bogs."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Isn’t it cruel to turn men into such hideous forms?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("You need not pity them. Once, these were... evil men... murderers and outlaws, no better than the orcs you hunt. I have transformed them so their physical forms match the spirits within. Is that not fitting? No punishment is too great for their kind."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("I suppose so..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22T'shar%20Lggi%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("The big wolf is done with."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "capture",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_capturer_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "victory",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Sacking goblin villages is all well and good, but corpses and bats will not stand up to full orcish warriors."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Have some patience. We have only just begun your training. These carcasses will supply you sufficient resources for practice. When you have mastered the basics, we will then assault the orcs and you will see your forces grow quickly."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_villages",
            variable: "villages",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "villages",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "village_var",
                value: "village_$this_item.x|_$this_item.y|_cleared",
                mode: "value",
              },
            ],
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_17",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Malin%20Keshar%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I’m not ready to die yet..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_18",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Darken%20Volk%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Fool boy! With my demise, none in this world will aid you..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_19",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Your incompetence at this simple task is appalling. You will never grow strong enough to be of use to me."),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
